  "final_message": "已等到并核验内容负责人回应，第二校对现已按约结束。\n\n- `COORD-06` 已处理：内容负责人明确回复仅“已成稿”，尚未证实发送、接收或确认。\n- 仍未确认：实际发送凭证、现场接收回执，以及时间、桌面、投影实机、人员和物料条件。\n- 未向协调者执行交接；独立分支 `xq-content-proofread-2` 保留，校对认领已释放，原内容负责人继续推进 `XQ-CONTENT`。\n- 本次证据等级为 `locally_verified`，不代表现场验收或正式 `XQ-REVIEW`。\n\n记录见[第三轮接收确认记录](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/parallel-ownership/project/deliverables/xingqiao-collaboration-review.md:88)、[核验证据](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/parallel-ownership/project/.work-receipts/proofread2-followup-evidence-report.json:8)和[最终检查点](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/parallel-ownership/project/.work-receipts/proofread2-followup-final-checkpoint.json:2)。",
